{"id": "3286901", "name": "שחזור הגרדיאנט משתי הרכבות חד-ממדיות - גרסה מעוצבת", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">כלל השרשרת בכיוון ההפוך</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\">תהי \\(f:\\mathbb{R}^2\\to\\mathbb{R}\\) פונקציה דיפרנציאבילית בסביבה של הנקודה \\(P={{CT:0}}\\). נגדיר</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.9;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle h(t)=f\\left({{CT:1}},{{CT:2}}\\right)\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle g(t)=f\\left({{CT:3}},{{CT:4}}\\right)\\)</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 8px 0;\">נתון כי</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px 12px;\">\\(\\displaystyle h'(0)={{CT:5}}, \\qquad g'(1)={{CT:6}} \\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">א</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">מציאת הגרדיאנט</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 12px 0;\">השתמשו בכלל השרשרת כדי למצוא את \\(\\nabla f(P)\\).</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 9px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\nabla f(P)=\\bigl(f'_x(P),f'_y(P)\\bigr)=\\bigl(\\) [[input:ans1]] \\(\\displaystyle ,\\) [[input:ans2]] \\(\\displaystyle \\bigr)\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">ב</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">נגזרת כיוונית נוספת</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\">יהי וקטור היחידה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\\(\\displaystyle u=(a,b)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{{CT:7}}}}{{CT:8}} \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 12px 0;\">חשבו את הנגזרת הכיוונית של \\(f\\) בנקודה \\(P\\) בכיוון \\(u\\).</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 9px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f'_u(P)=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">שתי המסילות עוברות דרך אותה נקודה:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0; line-height: 1.9;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle ({{CT:1}},{{CT:2}})\\big|_{t=0}=P\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle ({{CT:3}},{{CT:4}})\\big|_{t=1}=P\\)</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">מהמבנה של המסילות מתקבל</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0; line-height: 1.9;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle (x'_1(0),y'_1(0))=({{CT:9}},{{CT:10}})\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle (x'_2(1),y'_2(1))=({{CT:11}},{{CT:12}})\\)</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">לפי כלל השרשרת,</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0; line-height: 1.9;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle h'(0)={{CT:9}}f'_x(P)+{{CT:10}}f'_y(P)={{CT:5}}\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle g'(1)={{CT:11}}f'_x(P)+{{CT:12}}f'_y(P)={{CT:6}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">שתי משוואות אלה נותנות</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\nabla f(P)=({{CT:13}},{{CT:14}}) \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">כעת \\(u=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{{CT:7}}}}{{CT:8}}\\), ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle f'_u(P)=u\\cdot\\nabla f(P)={{CT:15}} \\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:pgx]] [[feedback:pgy]] [[feedback:pdu]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 7, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 7, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 9, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "pdu", "value": 0.3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "tans3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pdu-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>נכון.</strong> הנגזרת הכיוונית חושבה נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pdu-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">השתמשו ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'_u(P)=u\\cdot\\nabla f(P)\\)</span> לאחר שמצאתם את הגרדיאנט.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "pgx", "value": 0.35, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions